<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1"><img src="2504.20468v1/attn.png" id="S5.T7.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:411/181;" width="411" height="181" alt="Refer to caption"></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:70%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S5.T7.fig1.13" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:129%;">Table 5</span>: </span><span id="S5.T7.fig1.14" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:129%;">Attention visualization between the text tokens and vision tokens.<span id="S5.T7.fig1.14.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> The intensity of each text token’s background indicates the attention weight magnitude of image tokens, with darker highlights representing higher attention. The attention values above the 0.995th quantile are shown with the highest color intensity (such as <span id="S5.T7.fig1.14.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">shrimp</span> and <span id="S5.T7.fig1.14.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">vegetables</span>).</span></span></figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="S5.T7.fig2" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_align_middle" style="width:183.8pt;">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<table id="S5.T7.fig2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="S5.T7.fig2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S5.T7.fig2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt" style="padding:0.2pt 4.3pt;"><math id="S5.T7.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathsize="0.700em">r</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r</annotation></semantics></math></th>
<th id="S5.T7.fig2.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt" style="padding:0.2pt 4.3pt;"><math id="S5.T7.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathsize="0.700em">a</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a</annotation></semantics></math></th>
<td id="S5.T7.fig2.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" style="padding:0.2pt 4.3pt;"><span id="S5.T7.fig2.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:70%;">CP-Bench</span></td>
